1
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:03,100
"Kiss Or Kill"

2
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
(Episode 6)

3
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,760
If you're going to grab me,

4
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:15,120
you at least need a reason.

5
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,959
You know exactly why.

6
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:22,280
It's about the problem
with the last shipment.

7
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,200
Stop playing dumb.

8
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:26,959
Your background,

9
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:29,719
I've already dug up everything about it.

10
00:01:29,959 --> 00:01:31,120
Let's hear it then.

11
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:33,318
You little punk.

12
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,959
Still acting tough at death's door.

13
00:01:35,879 --> 00:01:37,039
A mere mercenary,

14
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:38,358
pretending to be a guide?

15
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:39,799
You came to me first.

16
00:01:39,959 --> 00:01:41,000
It was a fair trade.

17
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:43,078
But now that Lin Yan controls the route,

18
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:44,158
and you can't get it,

19
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,359
you're framing me.

20
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,519
If you dare touch me,

21
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,480
Lin Yan won't let you off the hook.

22
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,959
Don't use Lin Yan to threaten me.

23
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,798
I don't buy that crap.

24
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:54,840
Listen up.

25
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,439
I'm his man.

26
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,279
How many days have you even been with him?

27
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,640
The number of days doesn't matter.

28
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,359
What matters is,

29
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,680
I'm by his side now.

30
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,240
You little punk.

31
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,240
Lin Yan and I grew up together.

32
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,359
When we were pissing
against the wall together,

33
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,758
who knows where you even were.

34
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:16,840
Don't think I don't know.

35
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,479
You had ulterior motives
from the very start.

36
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,400
I guessed right, didn't I?

37
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:24,400
Your target wasn't me.

38
00:02:24,719 --> 00:02:25,879
It's Lin Yan.

39
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,560
Does he know?

40
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:30,759
Damn it.

41
00:02:46,798 --> 00:02:47,918
On your knees!

42
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,840
Brother Scorpion, that's enough.

43
00:02:58,439 --> 00:03:00,199
Such a beautiful mansion,

44
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,560
yet it has a place like this.

45
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:03,800
What did you do to the goods?

46
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,239
After the last batch of
samples was handed over,

47
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,919
the buyer found them all damp.

48
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,280
From receiving to delivering,

49
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,679
only three of us handled it.

50
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:15,240
You, me, and Lin Yan.

51
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,039
So what?

52
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,639
So instead of questioning Lin Yan,

53
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:22,360
you come to me first.

54
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:24,159
Is it because you don't dare touch him,

55
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:28,039
or do you think I'm an easier target?

56
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,680
I'm asking you!

57
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:33,240
If I were the one who tampered with it,

58
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:35,200
I would have run away long ago.

59
00:03:35,279 --> 00:03:37,666
If I wanted to leave tonight,
do you think you could stop me?

60
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,120
But I didn't run.

61
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,560
Do you know why?

62
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,560
Because Lin Yan is here.

63
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,439
So I won't leave.

64
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:51,960
You.

65
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,360
You're coming for him.

66
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,680
You just figured that out?

67
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,280
Black Scorpion.

68
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,080
Come out.

69
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
A-yan.

70
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,960
Second Uncle.

71
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,920
Why did you take Nie Chuan?

72
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,560
Come up.

73
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,439
I don't care who you're after.

74
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,079
There's a problem with this batch of goods.

75
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:41,360
Someone needs to take the fall.

76
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,319
You're an outsider.

77
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:47,318
You're definitely taking the blame.

78
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,720
You call me an outsider.

79
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,240
What about you?

80
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,839
What are you to him?

81
00:04:58,439 --> 00:05:00,160
I'm his brother.

82
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:02,639
Brother?

83
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,800
What are you laughing at?

84
00:05:04,279 --> 00:05:05,639
Laughing at your naivety.

85
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,040
The one who did this

86
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:09,560
is your brother.

87
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,480
You still dare to laugh?

88
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,958
Do you think Lin Yan

89
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:20,759
would fall out with me over you?

90
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:22,198
From my first day at Lin,

91
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,239
I've been by his side.

92
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:25,159
The hardships he endured,

93
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,040
the blood he shed,

94
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,720
which one of them

95
00:05:26,721 --> 00:05:28,360
didn't I shield him from?

96
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,319
You little punk,

97
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,239
who the hell do you think you are?

98
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,439
He's almost here.

99
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:34,720
Hurry up.

100
00:05:34,721 --> 00:05:36,160
Let me tell you,

101
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,959
the label of a mole,

102
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:44,439
is yours to wear.

103
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,120
Second Uncle.

104
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,438
Nie Chuan is my man.

105
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,518
If you want to touch him,

106
00:06:07,519 --> 00:06:08,879
you should at least tell me first.

107
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,720
A-yan.

108
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,039
I've taught you since you were little,

109
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,480
people's hearts are unpredictable.

110
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,759
Don't trust outsiders easily.

111
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,319
Have you forgotten?

112
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,360
I haven't forgotten.

113
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,120
That's why I'm keeping him.

114
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:26,278
A man of unknown origin

115
00:06:26,279 --> 00:06:27,480
is safer kept under my nose

116
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,079
than left out of sight.

117
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:31,240
You're using him.

118
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,040
I wouldn't call it using.

119
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,600
I just want to see

120
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,120
what exactly he's up to.

121
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,560
He's got good skills,

122
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,079
and he's smart enough.

123
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,560
Keeping him for a few days
lets me have some fun.

124
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:48,360
Have some fun?

125
00:06:50,519 --> 00:06:51,559
A-yan.

126
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,519
You never just play around.

127
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:55,479
Since you were a kid,

128
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,000
everything you've done

129
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:58,959
has had a purpose.

130
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,639
If you say you're playing,

131
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,040
then you're serious.

132
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:07,959
Let's go.

133
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,920
Let's go see your toy.

134
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:22,439
A-ren.

135
00:07:22,959 --> 00:07:24,040
What are you doing here?

136
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,319
Father sent me to add some spice.

137
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,560
What is this?

138
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:34,079
Don't be afraid.

139
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:36,559
You are Brother Yan's
good friend, after all.

140
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,040
I won't hurt you.

141
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,878
This is just something

142
00:07:39,879 --> 00:07:41,119
to make you talk comfortably.

143
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,160
Good stuff.

144
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,679
A-ren.

145
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:25,399
Go back to Second Uncle.

146
00:09:25,639 --> 00:09:26,759
You shouldn't be here.

147
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,080
Why?

148
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,440
I always get my toys from here.

149
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:32,720
Dad said there's a new toy today.

150
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,816
Brother Scorpion, are you
trying to fight me for it?

151
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,120
I'm not fighting you for it.

152
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,840
But Second Uncle needs you more right now.

153
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,960
Hurry and go.

154
00:09:40,639 --> 00:09:41,639
Fine.

155
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,320
I hope you can hold on.

156
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,560
Brother Yan hasn't played
with me in a long time.

157
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,839
If you die,

158
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,000
he'll be busy again.

159
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,240
Let's go.

160
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,759
Father, the injection is done.

161
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,120
How's it looking?

162
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:02,038
I don't know yet.

163
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,559
He hasn't started talking.

164
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,639
Good job. Go play.

165
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,320
Brother Yan.

166
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,159
Come play with me when you're done.

167
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,360
Second Uncle.

168
00:10:26,639 --> 00:10:27,879
He's too stubborn.

169
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,158
You've worked hard.

170
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,200
Step outside for now.

171
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:44,200
Kid, does it hurt?

172
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:47,240
Don't worry, it's just a short-acting drug.

173
00:10:47,679 --> 00:10:49,240
It won't kill you.

174
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:52,279
Since he hasn't said anything yet,

175
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,240
A-yan,

176
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:56,080
I'm giving him back to you.

177
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,679
Thank you, Second Uncle.

178
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,240
As for this drug,

179
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,799
it has some side effects.

180
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,480
You can bear them

181
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:12,240
for him.

182
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:15,919
If he's obedient,

183
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,200
it saves you trouble.

184
00:11:17,201 --> 00:11:18,679
If he's not,

185
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,200
it'll be a bit of a hassle.

186
00:11:26,879 --> 00:11:28,039
A-yan.

187
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,279
Don't forget

188
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,960
what your last name is.

189
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,440
You.

190
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:51,080
You're finally here.

191
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,440
A-yang.

192
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,600
We have to go.

193
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:09,159
Lie down.

194
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:14,000
Do you know

195
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,200
what they injected me with?

196
00:12:16,799 --> 00:12:18,840
Truth serum, and...

197
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,840
an aphrodisiac.

198
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,159
So,

199
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:24,279
are you here to interrogate me?

200
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,760
Did you think I came to save you?

201
00:12:37,799 --> 00:12:38,799
An outsider?

202
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:40,199
I only kept you around because

203
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,480
you still have some use to me.

204
00:12:41,919 --> 00:12:42,799
At the end of the day,

205
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:44,039
you're just a toy.

206
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:46,120
Once I get bored of you,

207
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,720
I'll just toss you aside.

208
00:12:48,639 --> 00:12:50,639
Three years ago, I owed you my life.

209
00:12:51,679 --> 00:12:53,159
But that's all in the past.

210
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,720
Now,

211
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:57,360
you're in my hands.

212
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:01,480
I decide how we play.

213
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,679
What exactly do you want?

214
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,878
There are cameras everywhere.

215
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:13,879
Don't move.

216
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:16,120
The more obedient you are,

217
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:18,039
the less you'll suffer.

218
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,320
Don't move.

219
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:30,000
The more obedient you are,

220
00:13:31,159 --> 00:13:32,840
the less you'll suffer.

221
00:13:41,519 --> 00:13:43,840
They say this drug loosens the tongue.

222
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,799
So let me ask you.

223
00:13:48,399 --> 00:13:49,879
Why did you stay at Lin?

224
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:52,440
What are you really after?

225
00:13:54,679 --> 00:13:56,000
I'm after you.

226
00:14:01,519 --> 00:14:02,879
You think I'd believe that?

227
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Don't be afraid.

228
00:14:17,879 --> 00:14:18,919
Lying

229
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,440
comes with a price.

230
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,519
Teach me.

231
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,920
Help me.

232
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,960
Teach me.

233
00:15:13,379 --> 00:15:14,538
Stop trembling.

234
00:15:23,679 --> 00:15:26,623
You can try topping me.

235
00:17:03,759 --> 00:17:05,000
Your hands are shaking.

236
00:17:08,759 --> 00:17:09,759
Lin Yan.

237
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,240
Look at me.

238
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:13,880
Look at me.

239
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:18,920
The things you said in
the interrogation room,

240
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,480
were you just acting?

241
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:25,319
And when your hands
shook while touching me,

242
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:27,319
was that an act too?

243
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,279
I know the answer now.

244
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:41,599
The drug really is an aphrodisiac.

245
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:43,960
If I didn't do that,

246
00:17:45,119 --> 00:17:46,799
Second Uncle would have gotten suspicious.

247
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,359
So you were helping me.

248
00:17:48,559 --> 00:17:49,960
I was helping myself.

249
00:17:51,759 --> 00:17:53,279
Did you achieve your goal?

250
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,680
Not yet.

251
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:59,319
I need that batch of goods
to be completely ruined.

252
00:18:00,079 --> 00:18:01,680
Not just the samples getting damp.

253
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,640
Why?

254
00:18:04,759 --> 00:18:06,038
I don't want Lin

255
00:18:06,039 --> 00:18:08,039
to have a smooth deal
with the Black Moon Society.

256
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,559
I wasn't asking

257
00:18:11,119 --> 00:18:12,400
about the deal.

258
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,599
My father

259
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,519
was Lin Mao.

260
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,359
He founded the Lin clan.

261
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,160
Lin Cang is his younger brother.

262
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,200
He brought him into the business

263
00:18:42,799 --> 00:18:44,719
and gave him half the
family business to manage.

264
00:18:51,839 --> 00:18:53,399
Later, when the border fell into chaos,

265
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:55,920
Lin Cang started war profiteering.

266
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,680
My father told him to stop.

267
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:00,960
He refused.

268
00:19:07,519 --> 00:19:09,640
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

269
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,880
That night, Lin Cang brought his men,

270
00:19:18,319 --> 00:19:19,559
broke into my house,

271
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,079
and killed my parents.

272
00:19:24,599 --> 00:19:26,000
He thought I wasn't there.

273
00:19:27,753 --> 00:19:30,440
But I was hiding under the bed,
not daring to make a sound.

274
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,519
That year,

275
00:19:33,559 --> 00:19:34,759
I was seven.

276
00:20:07,039 --> 00:20:08,039
I'm sorry for your loss.

277
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,559
Don't succumb to misery.

278
00:20:13,079 --> 00:20:14,399
Lin Cang pinned their deaths

279
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,680
on his rivals,

280
00:20:16,039 --> 00:20:17,799
using it as an excuse to wipe them out.

281
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,720
Then he adopted me.

282
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,759
Everyone praised him for his righteousness.

283
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,839
He did it so cleanly

284
00:20:27,359 --> 00:20:28,719
that even my father's trusted aides

285
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,759
never suspected a thing.

286
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:32,480
And so, he naturally

287
00:20:32,839 --> 00:20:34,079
took over the Lin clan.

288
00:20:35,079 --> 00:20:40,726
I've waited nineteen years, making
him believe I'm just an obedient nephew.

289
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:44,519
The time has finally come.

290
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:49,224
This deal is his biggest in recent years.

291
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,440
Once the goods are compromised,

292
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,200
he won't just lose money.

293
00:20:53,359 --> 00:20:54,399
He'll lose his reputation.

294
00:20:55,119 --> 00:20:56,119
In the arms trade,

295
00:20:56,426 --> 00:20:58,026
reputation is more important than money.

296
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,599
So what's your plan?

297
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,559
Bit by bit,

298
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:05,519
his goods,

299
00:21:06,319 --> 00:21:07,359
his men,

300
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,759
I'll tear it all down.

301
00:21:18,279 --> 00:21:19,440
You can't do this

302
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:21,599
all by yourself.

303
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:23,240
But I don't want to wait anymore.

304
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,079
I'm with you.

305
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:28,920
It's going to be a tough road.

306
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,559
I'm not afraid.

307
00:21:33,559 --> 00:21:34,640
So,

308
00:21:35,519 --> 00:21:36,720
was it true?

309
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,640
What?

310
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:47,160
You said I was your toy.

311
00:21:53,279 --> 00:21:54,598
So, are you satisfied

312
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:55,799
with this toy?

313
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:57,680
It's too noisy.

314
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:58,680
I want a new one.

315
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:01,240
Then next time,
you can show me a quiet one.
